 ional Trumpet Guild Journal</em>. As a recording artist\, he has released
  three critically acclaimed solo albums and a chamber music album with Br
 assworks on the MSR label. He is a Yamaha Performing Artist and performs 
 exclusively on Yamaha trumpets.</p>
