 nternational Violin Competition\, Tibor Varga Junior Competition\, Menuhi
 n Young Artists Competition in England\, and Andrea Postacchini Young Vio
 linists Competition in Italy\, among others. Kalinovsky started his music
  education with Tatiana Liberova in his native St. Petersburg\, Russia. A
 fter coming to New York\, he continued his studies with Pinchas Zukerman 
 and Patinka Kopec at the Manhattan School of Music\, where he later serve
 d as a faculty member for 15 years until his move to Indiana University.<
