 tinee Musicale Collegiate Scholarship Competition\, Lima Symphony Orchest
 ra Young Artist Competition\, and Ladies Musical Club of Seattle Award To
 ur Competition. As a collaborator\, she has played with the University of
  Washington Symphony Orchestra and the modern music ensemble Inverted Spa
 ce. An educator and a music advocate\, Yao has worked with students of al
